{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のプリンシパル二日目は二回公演でしたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも二幕は出れませんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二回とも楽屋でモニターから見ていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりレッツゴーポリン姫は面白いな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか私、プリンシパルまだ三回しかやってないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自分を出すことが難しくなってるって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由に無邪気な私の本当の姿が確かにあった筈なのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は何故か出ないんだ〜。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って自分で無邪気とか言うなっ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと出したとしてもあまり良く思われなかった懐かしいセンター時代笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルでもいろいろな事件的なものが多々ありました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中々難しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のこういう所見てって言えない。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも気づけたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからのプリンシパルで良い方向に進めばいいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}